=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">issued</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">redeemed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 批计提面值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是截至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的累计核销率。式子的输入全部来自台账本身（已发行、已核销），因此可被审计复核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"断点与对账-让风控口径与财务口径说同一种话\">断点与对账：让风控口径与财务口径说同一种话</h2><p>台账上线之后，真正的工作量在对账（reconciliation）：<strong>发放日志、台账分录、支付流水、财务总账</strong>四本账必须以固定周期两两对平，差值要能解释。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对账对象</th>\n<th>常见差异来源</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发放日志 ↔ 台账分录</td>\n<td>幂等键缺失导致重复入账；MQ 丢消息导致漏账</td>\n<td>补记 + 幂等键回填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>台账分录 ↔ 支付流水</td>\n<td>打款悬挂（已出账未到款 / 已到款未出账）</td>\n<td>建悬挂账户，T+1 冲平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累计核销率 ↔ 实际使用</td>\n<td>作弊团伙集中核销、退货潮</td>\n<td>触发反作弊复核，回溯撤销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>台账负债余额 ↔ 财务总账</td>\n<td>跨币种折算、期间归属错位</td>\n<td>按月重估、汇差单列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有一类差异不能靠对账消除，只能靠<strong>隔离</strong>：作弊。批量领奖与真实领取在台账上表现完全一样（都是「计提」分录），差别只在后续行为分布。所以台账要给每笔分录带上归因特征（设备指纹哈希、IP 归属、推荐链深度），并把可疑批次挂在单独的「待复核」负债科目里，而不是混进主负债。复核确认作弊后走反向分录冲回并计入追回款——<strong>不要删除分录</strong>。留存负向分录的价值在于：它让「本季度因作弊冲回多少」成为可查询指标，这正是投放预算调整的依据。</p>\n<p>三级以上分销的合规红线、以及它如何限制台账里「多级收益」科目的深度，见 <a href=\"../referral-program-model-incentive-design/program-rules-region-compliance-design\">计划规则与地区合规边界设计</a>；奖励金额本身的定价与增量测算，见 <a href=\"../referral-program-model-incentive-design/referral-incentive-economics-incrementality\">激励经济学与增量性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境税务-遗产归属与失效合规\">跨境税务、遗产归属与失效合规</h2><p>奖励一旦离开平台内部（变成可提现现金），账务模型就要把税务和监管一并纳入，否则会在结算季集中暴露。</p>\n<p><strong>美国税务（2026 年）</strong>。支付给个人的推荐奖金属于应税收入，平台在超过门槛时有信息申报义务。1099-NEC / 1099-MISC 的门槛仍是 <strong>600 美元/年</strong>，申报截止日为次年 1 月 31 日（IRS，<a href=\"https://www.irs.gov/instructions/i1099nec）。1099-K\">https://www.irs.gov/instructions/i1099nec）。1099-K</a> 门槛曾在 2021 年被降到 600 美元，IRS 通过 Notice 2024-85 给出过渡放宽，此后 <strong>One Big Beautiful Bill Act（2025 年 7 月签署）把门槛永久恢复为 20,000 美元且 200 笔交易</strong>——这意味着仅靠 1099-K 覆盖小额高频的推荐打款是覆盖不住的，平台仍要自己按 600 美元门槛做 1099-NEC 判定。台账因此需按「收款人 × 纳税年度」累计可提现奖励，并区分可提现与仅站内可用（后者不构成支付，不触发申报）。</p>\n<p><strong>遗产归属（unclaimed property / escheatment）</strong>。美国多数州规定，未核销的储值余额（含可兑换券，视州而定）在 3–5 年不动后须上缴州财政，年限按持卡人最后已知地址所在州判定。这推翻了「券过期就是零成本」的假设：<strong>过期不等于免除义务，只是义务从「欠用户」变成「可能欠州」</strong>。跨境平台常把未核销奖励按账单地址分州归集，超过法定休眠期的部分单列负债，不做 breakage 收益确认。</p>\n<p><strong>中国场景</strong>。企业向个人发放的现金类推荐奖励通常按「偶然所得」或「劳务报酬所得」代扣代缴个人所得税（20% 量级），口径源自财税〔2011〕50 号对网络红包的规定。《禁止传销条例》第七条对「以发展人员数量计酬」设有红线：推荐深度超过三级且按团队业绩计提，会同时触碰合规与账务——账务上的表现是「无法确认单笔奖励对应哪一次真实获客」。</p>\n<p><strong>欧盟与消费税</strong>。多国对礼品卡/代金券的增值税按「发行时不征税、核销时征税」的通行原则处理，因此核销分录必须带完整税务维度（品类税率、买家所在国），不能只记金额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>奖励台账的复杂度不在金额，而在「同一笔钱有四个身份」——增长口径的成本、会计口径的负债、税务口径的收入、监管口径的可能上缴。压进一张 <code>status</code> 字段，只会在第一次审计或第一次大促退货潮时集中爆掉。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>复式 + append-only</strong>：状态由不可变分录推导，撤销即反向分录，杜绝覆盖式修改。</li>\n<li><strong>发放即计提</strong>：资格动作达成即确认负债；抵扣冲减收入（consideration payable to a customer），不是增加市场费用。</li>\n<li><strong>失效按比例确认</strong>：依据 ASC 606-10-55-48 至 55-53 / IFRS 15 BC 388，用台账里的实际核销率做输入。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等键强制</strong>：MQ 重投与打款重试必须与账本唯一键绑定，否则借贷平衡掩盖重复发放。</li>\n<li><strong>四账按期对平</strong>：发放日志、台账分录、支付流水、财务总账，差异要么能解释、要么走隔离科目。</li>\n<li><strong>合规三件套</strong>：美国 1099-NEC 600 美元门槛（IRS，2026 年仍有效）、州级遗产归属 3–5 年休眠期、中国个税与《禁止传销条例》三级红线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"奖励台账与账务记账模型","id":"奖励台账与账务记账模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：奖励台账是一本复式账，不是一张活动表","id":"核心概念-奖励台账是一本复式账-不是一张活动表"},{"level":2,"text":"台账数据模型：账户、分录与幂等","id":"台账数据模型-账户-分录与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"计提、核销、失效：三个时刻的会计处理","id":"计提-核销-失效-三个时刻的会计处理"},{"level":2,"text":"断点与对账：让风控口径与财务口径说同一种话","id":"断点与对账-让风控口径与财务口径说同一种话"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境税务、遗产归属与失效合规","id":"跨境税务-遗产归属与失效合规"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推荐关系生命周期与失效撤销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/referral-relation-lifecycle-expiry"},"next":{"title":"奖励发放与履约通道工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/reward-ledger-fulfillment-operations/reward-fulfillment-payout-channel"}}